  "instructions": [
    "Cook the rice noodles according to the package instructions and set aside.",
    "In a large pot, combine the pho bo broth, smoked tofu, and char-grilled onions, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the cooked black beans to the pot and stir to combine.",
    "Prepare the lotus leaf wraps by soaking them in water for 30 seconds.",
    "Assemble the pho by placing some noodles, bean sprouts, and black bean mixture into each lotus leaf wrap.",
    "Garnish with scallions, sriracha sauce, and a lime wedge, if desired.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy.",
